In Fig. \ref{fig:TuringCondition}a.ii, a pattern characterized by $\lambda=7.5$ develops, representing the Fourier component with far and away the greatest growth rate.
In Fig. \ref{fig:TuringCondition}b.ii, the initial state is unstable such that the perturbation manifests a spatial pattern with $\lambda=15$ corresponding to the Fourier component with the
