    \includegraphics[width=1\linewidth]{phi4_hysteresis_loop_geometry.pdf}
    \caption{Geometric method to explain the scaling exponent in the fast driving regime. $\sigma=0.7, v_H=1000$ are used to generate the hysteresis loop while the central transition curve represents the equilibrium limit.}
