	To give the proofs of Theorems of \ref{thm1} and \ref{thm2}, we need some auxiliary lemmas.
	\begin{comment}
		\begin{lemma}\label{lem20}
			The subgroup $H$ is an $(\alpha,0)$-regular set in ${\rm CayS}(G,S)$ if and only if one of the following occurs:
			\begin{enumerate}
