The data set was obtained from BCSC Research[4] and is kindly appreciated. Originally collected by the Breast Cancer Surveillance Consortium in 1996-2002, this dataset specifies risk factors for susceptibility to breast cancer. This data record consists of 16 columns and 4,62,563 rows. It is a multivariate data set with real and integer values.  

