The explanatory analysis conducted through the PCA has been provided that, among all different combinations, the number of components which explain almost the whole percentage of cumulative variability (at least 90\%) is distributed in the following way: 1 PC has been selected 0.94\% of times, 2 PC 75.54\%, 3 PC 23.07\% and 4 PC 0.45\%. 
