    the number of valid triples is $\Oh(w\cdot n\log n)$.

    Recall that for $i \in \ccal$ the vertex $c_i \in C_i$ is the center of cluster $i$.
    We will populate table $\inner$ indexed by valid triples, so that $\inner[t,i,v]$ will store the exact $(v,c_i)$-distance within the graph $G[V_t]$.
