\smallskip
\noindent
\textbf{DPDK.}
DPDK was ported to the CHERI Morello using \textit{hybrid} mode~\cite{dpdk-morello}. However, the existing support is very limited and does not initialize nor use any NIC interface.
%A~\cite{dpdk-morello}, DPDK was ported to the CHERI Morello using \textit{hybrid} mode.
% For the DPDK, a first working port to CHERI Morello was done in hybrid mode~\cite{dpdk-morello}.
