Further research will focus on isolating all the components within the system, including finer-grained compartmentalization of the network stack and peripheral drivers. Additional scenarios include: (i)~the separation of DPDK from F-Stack and the application; and, (ii) the separation of the entire stack.
Future analysis will consider the design and potential impact of different synchronization strategies among compartments.
