\section{Conclusion and Future Work}
We provided a distributionally robust formulation for
a Bayesian diffusion control problem to mitigate model misspecification and overpessimism. Although effective in the $\phi$-divergence uncertainty case, we believe that finding other more efficient numerical methods to reduce the overpessimism needs research efforts. We leave them for future work.
